{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/204111-zodiac-beasts-interactive-forum-rp","id":204111,"title":"Zodiac Beasts (Interactive Forum RP)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-21T13:01:35-07:00","id":204111,"title":"Zodiac Beasts (Interactive Forum RP)","content":"I know I posted this in the Story Hooks section, but damn it sounded like a pretty cool set up to me! Anyways, this game is designed for up to 13 people (12 players + 1 Story Teller) to take part in. The players will be one of the 12 Chinese Zodiac beasts, which consists of Dragon, Goat, Rooster, Dog, Snake, Rat, Monkey, Pig, Tiger, Ox, Rabbit, and Horse. Roles are first come, first serve.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Rules 1 - No one liner posts, about 1 paragraph each (4 or 5 lines) would be an acceptable amount.<br /> <br /> Rule 2 - Don't be a dick OOC. In character dickishness is perfectly acceptable.<br /> <br /> Rule 3 - This is a semi-durance RP, meaning you're inside Arcadia, and your Keeper (preferably played by the ST), has more power than you do. That being said, you need to find a way back home, while at the same time doing whatever tasks he commands of you. The other players are in the same boat as you, maybe you can work together to formulate a plan.<br /> <br /> <br /> Rule 4 - OOC chat should be done in ( ) in order to let players know what is part of your activity, and what you wish to address outside the story. Don't think I have to actually mention this, but thought I'd do it anyways.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> -----------------------------------<br /> <br /> <br /> Collecting figurines has been a hobby of yours, and your last purchase was from some Chinese gift shop. You bought a golden figurine of your Zodiac animal, thinking it would be pretty cool for your collection. After putting it on your bedside and going to sleep last night, you awaken to find two things amiss. One, you're inside a cold, metal cage instead of your nice warm bed. And two, you've become your Zodiac animal! Thankfully you seem to be some manner of hybrid, rather than a full beast, and therefor have access to your digits. Maybe you can open the cage from the inside out! As your senses begin to flare, the image of the store owner from yesterday appears before you, holding the figurine you bought with one hand, and stroking it with the other... &quot;Now I have the full set!&quot; he says, as you notice you're not the only cage in the room.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> (And Commence! By the way, I'm just going to sit back and watch. Don't know enough about the game to be an effect ST or Player.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T11:28:35-07:00","id":205166,"title":"","content":"(Awww. D: Was hoping this would get interest. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T11:50:14-07:00","id":205186,"title":"","content":"Sorry mate, you may have better luck in the play by post forum.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post\"> Play by Post - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> For playing roleplaying games on the forums. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T11:56:21-07:00","id":205195,"title":"","content":"Thanks, I'll repost this over there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T21:35:06-07:00","id":205640,"title":"","content":"Maybe you want to make a recruitment thread as well?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T21:39:56-07:00","id":205642,"title":"","content":"I'm unfamiliar with how these things typically go on Onyx Path, but I have a couple of extra thoughts. Perhaps renaming this one to make clear it's a recruitment thread or somesuch (with a link to its Play by Post OOC and IC threads) may get it some more attention. Getting some people to express interest, even volunteer in a tentative fashion, could also help increase interest in turn: knowing other people are in on something can help.<br /> EDIT: Whoops, looks like ArcaneArts beat me to the punch on that suggestion.<br /> <br /> On which note, I might advise you yourself to join as a player. If we treat this as less &quot;players stat up and play C:tL characters by the book&quot; and handle things in a more freeform fashion, then it wouldn't as necessary for you to have the books. Particularly given it's a Durance: the characters are generally expected to know nothing of the fey. I also recall the Core advising some unorthodox options when playing out a prologue in Arcadia, meaning freeform would fit all the better.<br /> <br /> As a practical matter, it may be best to revise things juuuust a bit. The idea of getting a &quot;full cast&quot; for something like this is cool, but the idea of needing 13 people can be a bit intimidating. Perhaps tweak it so that there are 13 roles available, but the game will play out with however many people show interest. Well, once an ST's on board.<br /> <br /> Just some food for thought. If some time passes and there still aren't any/many bites, but you'd like to keep trying, it may also be worth asking if anyone on the fence has anything in particular that keeps them from signing up. Opening that dialogue and being willing to make tweaks can get more to buy in.<br /> <br /> I'm shorter on time than I wish I was, but I can express some tentative interest at this point in time. ^_^o I'm unable to say if/when that will lead to activity, I'm afraid, but hey! It's a start.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":558,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","user":"Gaius","date":".  Spotted a ninja. Also, this seems to be Post #600 for me, so that's cool. 07-23-2014, 12:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T07:04:49-07:00","id":206045,"title":"","content":"Free Form was, indeed, the way I was intending this to go. Like I said, I don't know enough about the game to get into any of the overly complex rules, so I'd pretty much just wing it the whole way through.<br /> <br /> <br /> We don't actually need 13 people, it's just set up to accommodate them. Not every slave the Gentry take manages to escape, after all.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'll go ahead and make a recruitment thread then, as well as list which positions are already taken.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T14:55:45-07:00","id":206581,"title":"","content":"<b>Play:</b> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/205196-ic-zodiac-beasts\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...-zodiac-beasts</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Recruit:</b> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/206054-recruitment-thread-zodiac-beasts-ooc\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...iac-beasts-ooc</a><br /> <br /> <br /> :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}